{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cb6d","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a07db8-a28a-7e80-8be1-e3a988123386"},"sequence":1041,"recorded_at":1780531400002077,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"4385e4d6-e071-42f2-a438-a44213370546","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"4385e4d6-e071-42f2-a438-a44213370546","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"4385e4d6-e071-42f2-a438-a44213370546"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"ea39728a-91b5-4884-8db4-754c81c02ce4"},"task_id":"ea39728a-91b5-4884-8db4-754c81c02ce4","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"ea39728a-91b5-4884-8db4-754c81c02ce4","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 1772-1782\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-and a third covers the 24 handled v1 event types against the pinned Section\n-5.2 registry, each row naming its lifecycle-or-fact class and driver. The\n-alias audit keeps the funnel and the watched owner delegations\n-(`DecodeStrictObject`, `CheckUUIDv7`, `CheckUint53Bounds`, `ParseDigest`,\n-`ParseUUIDv4`, `ParseUUIDv7`, `ParseProviderID`, `ParseID`) in direct-call\n-position, proved by plants that include an import alias and a var binding in\n-both directions. The mutation battery (26 applied, 26 killed, 0 survivors; 12\n-narrowing, 8 arm-deletion, 3 census-test, 3 audit-only; plus NOT_APPLIED and\n-COMPILE_FAIL controls) covers the reduce, decode, and project paths —\n-including the tie, the gap, the parked channel, and the TestMain-only audit\n-layer — and is recorded on the owning task board item.\n+and a third covers the 24 handled v1 event types derived from every\n+production dispatch on event type against the pinned Section 5.2 registry,\n+each row naming its lifecycle-or-fact class and driver; a second switch\n+dispatch site outside `effect` fails the census closed. The\n+alias audit keeps the funnel and the watched owner delegations\n+(`DecodeStrictObject`, `CheckUUIDv7`, `CheckUint53Bounds`, `ParseDigest`,\n+`ParseUUIDv4`, `ParseProviderID`, `ParseID`) in direct-call\n+position, proved by plants that include an import alias and a var binding in\n+both directions. The mutation battery (28 applied, 28 killed; 14\n+narrowing, 8 arm-deletion, 3 census-test, 3 audit-only) covers the reduce, decode, and project paths —\n+including the tie, the gap, the union and local-lease derivation, the parked channel, and the TestMain-only audit\n+layer — and is recorded on the owning task board item. The harness ships two\n+live controls that both compile and reach both gates: neutral `XN` survives as\n+intended (the only intended survivor, bounded to a behaviour-neutral identity\n+transform), and known-bad `XK` is killed as intended.\n"}}}
