come attached as round-2 resources.\\n...\\n8:### TASK-260830-1r9wrr: session-state reducer landed; no re-attestation outside the leaf\\n12:- EVIDENCE: outcome `TASK-260830-1r9wrr_outcome.md` on the board task (10/10 AC rows with call sites, gate table, three censuses, 26/26 killed battery with narrowing/arm-deletion/census-test/audit-only + NOT_APPLIED/COMPILE_FAIL rows, tree OID + exact changed paths). Harness `.temp/TASK-260830-1r9wrr/mutate.sh` (gitignored scratch), log attached.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 19402,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 4851,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
